  "label": "The man is mapped as the person who maxes out intelligence and puts nothing on agility",
  "description": "The text 'when you max out intelligence and put nothing on agility' is mapped onto the visual entity 'man'. The man's appearance (curly hair, glasses, 80s-style clothing, sitting at a desk with an old computer, holding a mug) visually embodies the 'nerdy' or 'geeky' stereotype, which is humorously contrasted with the lack of physical agility. The mapping is established by the meme's overall intent to use the visual of a stereotypical intellectual to represent someone who prioritizes intelligence over physical prowess.",
